{"version":1,"content":"<p>內地小生成毅夥拍林更新主演的古裝劇《兩京十五日》播出以來穩坐收視及熱度之冠，近日幾位主角的片酬曝光，成毅收2千萬元人民幣（約2,352萬港元），林更新則有1,500萬元人民幣（約1,764萬港元）。</p><p>值得注意的是該劇僅得26集，比起成毅過去動</p>","scraped_at":"2026-11-26T16:24:24.688929+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":121,"images":0,"source":"東網 娛樂","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-26T16:01:03+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-26T16:17:34.987552+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-26T16:17:34.987552+00:00","content_hash":"3270ac573882cea009410ce1fb32401eb2e810db6c37c7e4637e4cd66ddec800","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}